  "text": "One invented citation can turn client-ready legal work into a credibility problem. The hallucination trap is an independent demo that catches it before a lawyer does. One UAE question goes to a source-free model and an official law pipeline. Watch the building collapse. Question: The first answer sounds certain. Article 1471. The audit checks it. Red, fabricated. The 2025 law ends at Article 1422. That citation cannot exist.The grounded path retrieves Article 821. Green shows the law and source with weak evidence. It refuses instead of guessing. Compare the scoreboards across 50 checked questions: 90% citation precision, 88.24% recall, and no false, fabricated verdicts across 84 real citations. That is the solution. Do not trust fluency alone. Make every citation face the official record."
